","rationale":"1/4 in bit through PETG flats at 20 N\u00b7m gives ~130-200 MPa vs 47 MPa yield; design never transmits torque through printed hex flats.","source_file":"sim/hand_calculation.md","source_location":"L35-L38","source_url":null},{"id":"sim_hand_calculation_key_bore_bearing","label":"Key-Bore Bearing p_max = 6M/(d\u00b7Le\u00b2)","_origin":"semantic","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":1,"community_name":"Torque Path & Stress Evidence","contributor":null,"file_type":"rationale","norm_label":"key-bore bearing p_max = 6m/(d\u00b7le2)","rationale":"Rigid peg in elastic socket with linear pressure; Le chosen so p_max \u2264 yield/2. Lowest SF 2.01 at 5 mm key. Ignores stress concentrations, so real FE may show higher peaks.","source_file":"sim/hand_calculation.md","source_location":"L13-L26","source_url":null},{"id":"docs_checks_fold_unfold_check","label":"Fold/Unfold Key Sweep Check (52 states)","_origin":"semantic","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":2,"community_name":"Model Checks & Printability","contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"fold/unfold key sweep check (52 states)","source_file":"docs/checks.md","source_location":"L8-L10","source_url":null},{"id":"docs_checks_interference_check","label":"Interference Check (packed kit, 12 bodies, 0 pairs)","_origin":"semantic","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":2,"community_name":"Model Checks & Printability","contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"interference check (packed kit, 12 bodies, 0 pairs)","source_file":"docs/checks.md","source_location":"L7","source_url":null},{"id":"docs_checks_overhang_check","label":"Steepest Overhang Check (45.0\u00b0, 0 bridges)","_origin":"semantic","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":2,"community_name":"Model Checks & Printability","contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"steepest overhang check (45.0\u00b0, 0 bridges)","source_file":"docs/checks.md","source_location":"L13","source_url":null},{"i